e target survives profile and modal remounts, so new snapshot reads wait for earlier admitted writes."},{"markdown":"Credential blur saves stay outside the positional fence so the following Activate or tab click is delivered. The queue survives pane remounts and serializes admitted credential writes. Activation waits for it, retains save failures, and checks its own lifetime and target again before changing configuration.","startLine":25,"endLine":25,"text":"Credential blur saves stay outside the positional fence so the following Activate or tab click is delivered. The queue survives pane remounts and serializes admitted credential writes. Activation waits for it, retains save failures, and checks its own lifetime and target again before changing configuration."},{"markdown":"Deactivation waits for credential writes to settle without requiring their success. It preserves failed saves for a later activation and rechecks the captured target before changing configuration.","startLine":27,"endLine":27,"text":"Deactivation waits for credential writes to settle without requiring their success. It preserves failed saves for a later activation and rechecks the captured target before changing configuration."},{"markdown":"Each snapshot carries the target mutation revision. A sibling write invalidates old reads and positional edit admission; stale views reload before writing. Successful refresh replaces the snapshot, and target changes still invalidate all UI callbacks.","startLine":29,"endLine":29,"text":"Each snapshot carries the target mutation revision. A sibling write invalidates old reads and positional edit admission; stale views reload before writing. Successful refresh replaces the snapshot, and target changes still invalidate all UI callbacks."},{"markdown":"[[src/renderer/src/hooks/useProfileEditorLifetime.ts#waitForProfileMemoryMutations]] waits for target-owned writes; [[src/renderer/src/hooks/useProfileEditorLifetime.ts#beginProfileMemoryMutation]] admits only m